[{"text": "I now give the floor uh to his", "start": 0.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "excellency Walton Alonso Webson, chair", "start": 3.04, "duration": 8.12}, {"text": "of delegation of Antigua and Barbuda.", "start": 6.48, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 36.48, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": ">> Fine. Thanks. Yep.", "start": 38.64, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": ">> M", "start": 42.079, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 43.6, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "distinguished", "start": 46.399, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "ministers of government and", "start": 48.079, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "representatives,", "start": 50.399, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "excellencies,", "start": 52.559, "duration": 5.801}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 54.48, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "I am indeed humbled and honored to be", "start": 58.399, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "asked to deliver this statement by the", "start": 61.68, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "honorable", "start": 64.879, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "prime minister of Antigga and Barbuda,", "start": 67.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the right honorable Gaston Brown on", "start": 69.76, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "behalf of the government and people of", "start": 72.56, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Antigga and Barbuda.", "start": 75.04, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "Mr. President, we meet once again at a", "start": 78.32, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "moment when history asks difficult", "start": 82.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "questions of this institution.", "start": 85.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Can multilateralism", "start": 88.88, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "still protect the weak as well as the", "start": 91.04, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "strong?", "start": 94.479, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "Can international law", "start": 96.0, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "restrain power rather than merely record", "start": 98.64, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "its consequences?", "start": 102.4, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Can development remain a promise for all", "start": 104.64, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "rather than a privilege for some?", "start": 108.72, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "For Antigga and Barbuda,", "start": 112.72, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "these are not philosophical questions.", "start": 115.68, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "for small island developing states.", "start": 119.28, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "These are questions of survival.", "start": 122.799, "duration": 8.481}, {"text": "As we begin the 81st session of this", "start": 127.04, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "general assembly, we stand between two", "start": 131.28, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "eras, one ending and another waiting to", "start": 134.64, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "be shaped.", "start": 138.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "At the end of this year, his excellency", "start": 140.16, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "Antonio Gutarz", "start": 143.52, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "will complete his tenure as secretary", "start": 145.599, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "general of the United Nation.", "start": 149.2, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "Antigga and Babuda places on record our", "start": 152.0, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "profound appreciation", "start": 156.8, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "for his service to this organization and", "start": 159.28, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "to the international community in", "start": 163.92, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "general. For my country, our", "start": 166.0, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "appreciation is deeply personal.", "start": 170.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "In 2017,", "start": 174.56, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Hurricane Irma devastated Barbuda.", "start": 176.48, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "The entire population had to be", "start": 181.04, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "evacuated.", "start": 183.68, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Homes were destroyed. Livelihoods", "start": 186.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "disappeared.", "start": 189.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "An island community was brought to its", "start": 191.44, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "knees. The Secretary General Gutirez", "start": 194.0, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "came to Antigga and Barbuda. He saw the", "start": 198.0, "duration": 9.519}, {"text": "devastation. He listened to our people.", "start": 201.68, "duration": 9.279}, {"text": "He understood what we small island", "start": 207.519, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "developing states have been telling the", "start": 210.959, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "world for decades. Climate change is not", "start": 214.48, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "waiting for the future.", "start": 218.56, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "It is already destroying lives,", "start": 221.2, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "economies, and communities.", "start": 224.159, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "The Secretary General continued to stand", "start": 227.84, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "with SIDS.", "start": 230.64, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "He returned to Antigga and Barbuda for", "start": 232.64, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "the fourth international conference on", "start": 236.48, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "small island developing states.", "start": 239.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "He championed vulnerable countries", "start": 242.799, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "and supported the international effort", "start": 246.56, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "that brought into being the", "start": 249.84, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "multi-vulnerability", "start": 252.64, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "index.", "start": 254.319, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "Whether confronted by climate change,", "start": 257.12, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "challenging inequalities", "start": 261.28, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "or calling for reform", "start": 263.68, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "the international financial system. He", "start": 266.4, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "was a fearless and principled advocate.", "start": 270.08, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "He never relented in demanding a fairer", "start": 274.479, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "world and he constantly placed the", "start": 278.4, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "concerns of small island developing", "start": 282.08, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "states before the international", "start": 284.479, "duration": 5.561}, {"text": "community.", "start": 287.04, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "For that solidarity, Antigga and Mabuda", "start": 294.08, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "thank him.", "start": 298.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "But excellencies, gratitude for the past", "start": 300.8, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "must now match by courage in shaping the", "start": 304.72, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "future.", "start": 309.52, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "The next secretary general of this", "start": 312.32, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "institution will inherit a United", "start": 314.639, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "Nations confronting wars and conflicts", "start": 317.68, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "that devastate lives and undermine", "start": 321.6, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "international capability.", "start": 326.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Deep", "start": 329.6, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "geopolitical", "start": 331.12, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "divisions will ex exist. Financial", "start": 333.759, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "constraints, the climate emergency and", "start": 337.28, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "declining trust will test that test our", "start": 341.28, "duration": 9.359}, {"text": "organization's capacity to respond.", "start": 345.52, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 350.639, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "the unite excellencies, the choice", "start": 352.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "before us is about more than selecting", "start": 355.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "an individual.", "start": 358.88, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "It is about the future direction of this", "start": 360.96, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "organization.", "start": 364.4, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "That is why Antigga and Babbuda has", "start": 366.16, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "nominated Maria Fernandez Espinosa to", "start": 369.36, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "serve as the next secretary general. We", "start": 374.0, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "believe that she is the right leader for", "start": 377.52, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "this moment.", "start": 380.479, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "After more than 80 years, no woman has", "start": 382.479, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "ever served as Secretary General. The", "start": 386.56, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "time is now.", "start": 389.36, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "Our", "start": 393.12, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "case for Miss Espinosa rests not because", "start": 398.24, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "not not on gender. It rests on", "start": 402.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "competence,", "start": 406.479, "duration": 4.681}, {"text": "experience,", "start": 408.16, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "independence and leadership. At a time", "start": 411.36, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "of fragmentation,", "start": 415.52, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "the United Nation needs a needs a", "start": 417.759, "duration": 8.641}, {"text": "credible bridge builder capable of", "start": 422.16, "duration": 9.68}, {"text": "restoring confidence in multilateralism.", "start": 426.4, "duration": 9.44}, {"text": "Antigga and Babuda believes that Maria", "start": 431.84, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "Fernandez Espinosa demonstrated that", "start": 435.84, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "when she was a leader here of the", "start": 438.8, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "General Assembly, we believe that she", "start": 441.12, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "can provide the leadership we need now.", "start": 444.16, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "Mr. President, multilateralism", "start": 449.039, "duration": 7.121}, {"text": "is under profound strain. Economic", "start": 452.08, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "uncertainties continue to grow.", "start": 456.16, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Technology is racing ahead of", "start": 460.24, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "governance.", "start": 462.56, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Artificial intelligence", "start": 464.16, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "offers extraordinary possibilities, but", "start": 466.56, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "it also raises profound concerns about", "start": 470.479, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "who will control its development and", "start": 474.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "share in its benefit. Small island", "start": 476.879, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "developing states must not be left out", "start": 480.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "as spectators.", "start": 482.72, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "Nor can we accept an international", "start": 485.12, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "international system in which rules are", "start": 489.039, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "binding upon the weak but negotiable for", "start": 492.56, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "the powerful.", "start": 497.12, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "International law must apply equally.", "start": 498.879, "duration": 9.201}, {"text": "Sovereignty cannot depend upon power nor", "start": 503.759, "duration": 9.321}, {"text": "justice upon one's friends.", "start": 508.08, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "Antigga and Barbuda", "start": 515.279, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "commands neither a a a great army nor", "start": 518.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "large markets.", "start": 522.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "International law, cooperation, and", "start": 525.12, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 528.64, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "are fundamental to our security and", "start": 530.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "stability.", "start": 534.64, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "For us, the United Nation is not", "start": 536.24, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "optional. It is essential to our", "start": 539.68, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "survival.", "start": 543.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "We support a more efficient,", "start": 545.279, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "coherent, and accountable United", "start": 548.8, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Nations. But efficiency cannot become", "start": 551.519, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "another word for retreat.", "start": 555.68, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "The UN80 reform process must be judged", "start": 559.68, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "by whether this organization", "start": 563.76, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "serves people better. For SIDS that", "start": 567.44, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "means protecting development the", "start": 571.6, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "development pillar, advancing", "start": 575.04, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "implementation of the Antigga and", "start": 577.68, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Barbuda agenda for SIDS Abbas and", "start": 580.16, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "bringing effective support closer to", "start": 584.48, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "those who need it most.", "start": 588.48, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "Mr. President, trade disputes, tariffs,", "start": 591.2, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "and economic fragmentation", "start": 595.519, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "raises the costs of food, transport, and", "start": 598.16, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "development.", "start": 602.08, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Too often, small island states pay the", "start": 607.12, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "price for disputes we did not create. We", "start": 610.8, "duration": 9.039}, {"text": "call upon the major economies to choose", "start": 615.76, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "dialogue and cooperation.", "start": 619.839, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "Fairness, Mr. President, must also must", "start": 623.04, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "also govern international finance.", "start": 626.48, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "A hurricane does not check GDP before", "start": 629.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "destroying a school.", "start": 633.839, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Rising seas does not consult income", "start": 636.56, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "classification before entering a home or", "start": 640.399, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "village.", "start": 643.36, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "That is why the multivvulnerability", "start": 644.8, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "index matters. It provides a fairer", "start": 647.519, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "measure of the structural", "start": 651.519, "duration": 6.601}, {"text": "vulnerabilities", "start": 655.12, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "vulnerabilities that small island states", "start": 658.16, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "and it helps GDP because GDP alone", "start": 661.36, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "cannot provide this measurement.", "start": 665.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Excellencies,", "start": 668.56, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "nowhere is the urgency greater than in", "start": 671.36, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "the climate crisis.", "start": 675.279, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "For small island developing states like", "start": 678.72, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "mine,", "start": 681.04, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "climate change is not a warning about", "start": 683.6, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "tomorrow. We are experiencing it today.", "start": 687.12, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "Warmer oceans fuel more destructive", "start": 691.2, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "hurricanes. Coastlines are retreating.", "start": 694.48, "duration": 7.88}, {"text": "Salt water.", "start": 698.88, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "Salt water", "start": 702.8, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "destroys fresh water and in throws upon", "start": 705.2, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "it, forcing countries like Antigga and", "start": 708.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "Barbuda to spend increasingly more", "start": 711.04, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "costly means to secure fresh drinking", "start": 713.839, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "water.", "start": 718.0, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "The General Assembly's high-level", "start": 719.519, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "meeting on sea level rise placed before", "start": 722.0, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "the international community fundamental", "start": 726.56, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "questions of statehood, sovereignty,", "start": 729.6, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "maritime rights,", "start": 734.48, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "displacement, culture, and identity.", "start": 736.88, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "Climate change must never be allowed to", "start": 741.2, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "erase a nation's sovereignty, its", "start": 746.0, "duration": 8.839}, {"text": "statethood, or the rights of its people.", "start": 749.279, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "Antigga and Barbuda and other vulnerable", "start": 758.959, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "states sought clarity on the obligations", "start": 762.399, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "of state of states in relationship to", "start": 766.399, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "climate change. The International Court", "start": 769.76, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "of Justice has spoken. Climate", "start": 773.519, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "obligations are not acts of generosity.", "start": 776.8, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "They are responsibilities", "start": 781.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "under international law. For small", "start": 783.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "states, international law is more than a", "start": 786.72, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "moral aspiration. It is our strategic", "start": 790.56, "duration": 9.2}, {"text": "shield. For SIDS, climate justice is", "start": 794.88, "duration": 7.88}, {"text": "survival.", "start": 799.76, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Our survival is is is inseparable from", "start": 803.519, "duration": 9.041}, {"text": "the ocean. The entry into force of BBJ", "start": 808.079, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "agreement is therefore an important", "start": 812.56, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "achievement for multilateralism", "start": 816.079, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "but implementation will be the real", "start": 818.639, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "test.", "start": 822.32, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "SIDs must share fairly in the benefits", "start": 824.88, "duration": 8.639}, {"text": "arising from marine genetic resources.", "start": 829.36, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "Capacity building must be me meaningful", "start": 833.519, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "and marine technology must be", "start": 837.12, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "accessible.", "start": 839.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Mr. Madame President, climate justice", "start": 841.44, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "cannot be separated from historic", "start": 844.959, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "justice. The Caribbean did not arrive at", "start": 848.16, "duration": 8.239}, {"text": "this moment on equal terms.", "start": 851.68, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "Centuries of enslavement", "start": 856.399, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and colonial ex extraction", "start": 859.279, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "transformed", "start": 862.639, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "trans transferred wealth from our", "start": 864.88, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "societies and denied generations the", "start": 867.04, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "means to build prosperity.", "start": 870.959, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "Political independence did not erase", "start": 875.68, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "those arms.", "start": 878.8, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Today, countries that contribute least", "start": 880.72, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "to climate change must borrow at high", "start": 884.399, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "cost and rebuild from disaster given um", "start": 887.92, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "um o overwhelmingly", "start": 892.399, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "by emo by emissions that we did not have", "start": 894.48, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "anything but that comes from afar. That", "start": 899.12, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "is where climate debts meets historic", "start": 902.399, "duration": 8.721}, {"text": "debts. Antigga and Babuda", "start": 906.48, "duration": 9.2}, {"text": "stands firm with Caraccom and Africa in", "start": 911.12, "duration": 8.399}, {"text": "demanding reparatory justice for people", "start": 915.68, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "of African descent.", "start": 919.519, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Reparatory justice requires", "start": 922.32, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "acknowledging responsibility,", "start": 925.68, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "repairing,", "start": 928.8, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "con continuing harm, and correcting", "start": 930.56, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "structures that still reproduce", "start": 934.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "inequality.", "start": 937.92, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "Expressions of regret are not enough.", "start": 940.0, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "Justice requires honest dialogue", "start": 944.079, "duration": 8.481}, {"text": "followed by concrete measures and repair", "start": 947.76, "duration": 9.36}, {"text": "and res restoration and development.", "start": 952.56, "duration": 9.12}, {"text": "Reparatory justice is not a favor. It is", "start": 957.12, "duration": 9.36}, {"text": "a claim grounded in responsibility,", "start": 961.68, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "equality and human dignity.", "start": 966.48, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "Madame President, development finds its", "start": 970.56, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "true meaning in the lives and dignity of", "start": 974.079, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "people.", "start": 977.759, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Non-communicable diseases cut short too", "start": 979.68, "duration": 7.64}, {"text": "many lives and", "start": 983.12, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "diminishes the quality of lives of too", "start": 987.6, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "many people in my country and in our", "start": 990.48, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "region. these diseases, detecting them", "start": 994.88, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "early and ensuring", "start": 999.12, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "effective treatment and uh national", "start": 1002.24, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "development priorities for Antigga and", "start": 1005.68, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Barbuda. Mental health challenges are", "start": 1008.16, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "increasing.", "start": 1012.24, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Preventable vision loss", "start": 1014.32, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "denies dozens and dozens of our people", "start": 1017.519, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "opportunities to learn, work, and live", "start": 1021.36, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "independently. Antigga and Barbuda will", "start": 1025.12, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "continue to champion mental health,", "start": 1028.0, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "strengthen our universal health", "start": 1031.199, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "programs, to address non-communicable", "start": 1033.039, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "diseases, and place eye health firmly", "start": 1037.28, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "within our development priorities.", "start": 1041.199, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "This November, Antigga and Babuda will", "start": 1045.199, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "host along with the Commonwealth heads", "start": 1048.799, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "of government a global eye health", "start": 1051.12, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "summit. the first of its kind to move", "start": 1054.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "the international community from", "start": 1057.919, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "advocacy to action against the growing", "start": 1060.48, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "burden of preventable sight loss. We", "start": 1063.76, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "invite member states and partners to", "start": 1067.84, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "join us and support an eye health", "start": 1071.36, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "compact that that expands access,", "start": 1074.799, "duration": 10.12}, {"text": "strengthens prevention and treatment.", "start": 1079.84, "duration": 5.079}, {"text": "mobilize this finance and integrate I", "start": 1085.6, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "health fully into our development", "start": 1089.919, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "strategies.", "start": 1092.96, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "Excellencies, two years ago, the", "start": 1094.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "international community gathered in", "start": 1097.679, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "Antigga and Barbuda and adopted the", "start": 1099.6, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "agenda for small island developing", "start": 1103.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "states, Abbas.", "start": 1105.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Our 10 our 10-year framework for", "start": 1108.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "sustainable development and resilient", "start": 1110.88, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "prosperity", "start": 1113.6, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "now excellencies becomes the real hard", "start": 1115.36, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "work of implementation.", "start": 1119.919, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "SIDs need finance technology", "start": 1123.039, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "capacity and institutions", "start": 1127.6, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "that would recognize vulnerability and", "start": 1130.08, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "work with us.", "start": 1132.96, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "The SIDS center of excellence", "start": 1134.96, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "will help turn Abbas's commitment into", "start": 1139.039, "duration": 7.681}, {"text": "practical solutions through the better", "start": 1143.28, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "data in innovation, investment and", "start": 1146.72, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "support for sustainable development.", "start": 1151.28, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "Abbas must move from commitment to", "start": 1154.64, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "implementation and SIDS must move from v", "start": 1157.919, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "from", "start": 1162.96, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "vulnerability towards resilient", "start": 1164.799, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "prosperity.", "start": 1168.24, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 1170.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "international financial architectures", "start": 1172.799, "duration": 7.161}, {"text": "must also change.", "start": 1176.0, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "The fourth international conference on", "start": 1183.52, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "financing for development", "start": 1186.72, "duration": 8.04}, {"text": "in which was held in civil Spain", "start": 1189.919, "duration": 4.841}, {"text": "placed debt and development finance", "start": 1196.4, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "close to the to the center of the", "start": 1200.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "international agenda.", "start": 1203.36, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "That pro that progress must now become", "start": 1206.0, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "action.", "start": 1210.16, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "Small states cannot develop sustainably", "start": 1211.679, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "when they must repeatedly borrow to", "start": 1215.919, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "rebuild. We cannot fulfill the promise", "start": 1219.44, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "of abbas when carrying unsustainable", "start": 1222.96, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "debts. Nor can we build resilience when", "start": 1227.12, "duration": 8.799}, {"text": "the cost of capital itself penalizes", "start": 1231.76, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "vulnerability.", "start": 1235.919, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "For too long, the international", "start": 1237.44, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "financial architecture has asked", "start": 1240.64, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "vulnerable countries how much debt can", "start": 1243.6, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "they carry. It must also ask how much", "start": 1246.64, "duration": 8.159}, {"text": "development can they achieve? How can", "start": 1250.24, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "countries realize their potential when", "start": 1254.799, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "debt services repeated shocks and high", "start": 1258.0, "duration": 8.48}, {"text": "borrowing costs consume the resources", "start": 1262.799, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "needed for schools, hospitals", "start": 1266.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "and resilient", "start": 1270.08, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "resilient development and", "start": 1272.0, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "transformation.", "start": 1273.84, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Finance must create fiscal space for", "start": 1279.039, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "development.", "start": 1283.919, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Vulnerable states", "start": 1285.44, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "need greater access to long-term", "start": 1288.159, "duration": 8.961}, {"text": "to to long-term affordable and", "start": 1293.52, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "predictable financing", "start": 1297.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "together. the debt solutions that", "start": 1299.6, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "respond to these real must respond to", "start": 1303.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "these real circumstances. Antigga and", "start": 1306.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Barbido call for the launch of the", "start": 1308.96, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "intergovernmental process on debt agreed", "start": 1311.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "upon in civil.", "start": 1314.559, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "Madame President, there can be no", "start": 1317.12, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "sustainable development without peace.", "start": 1320.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "But peace begins long before guns fall", "start": 1323.6, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "silent. It begins when young people see", "start": 1326.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "f a future. When solidarity provides", "start": 1329.84, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "food, education, employment, and", "start": 1333.36, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "opportunity, and when injustice is", "start": 1336.159, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "addressed before it becomes instability", "start": 1339.679, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "and conflict", "start": 1342.48, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "in a fractured world, the United Nations", "start": 1344.64, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "must renew", "start": 1347.2, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "um both its operational relevance and", "start": 1350.4, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "its moral clarity. It must help forge a", "start": 1354.08, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "new compact between development and", "start": 1357.679, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "developing countries.", "start": 1360.96, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "Connect finance to resilience and", "start": 1364.159, "duration": 8.321}, {"text": "support local leadership with global", "start": 1369.039, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "solidarity. Development is, Mr.", "start": 1372.48, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "President, an instrument of peace. The", "start": 1375.919, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "United Nations must invest as seriously", "start": 1379.6, "duration": 9.04}, {"text": "in in in preventing wars as it does in", "start": 1383.44, "duration": 9.28}, {"text": "responding after they begin.", "start": 1388.64, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "The diplomacy,", "start": 1392.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "mediation, and development must be", "start": 1394.88, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "central to that work.", "start": 1398.0, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Throughout every crisis,", "start": 1401.52, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "throughout every crisis, one principle", "start": 1404.64, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "must remain constant. International law", "start": 1407.28, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "must apply equally to all.", "start": 1410.72, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "The the credibility of the international", "start": 1415.039, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "system depends upon this consistency.", "start": 1417.919, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Madame President, the United Nation", "start": 1422.32, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "reform program must extend to the", "start": 1424.799, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "security council. its composition, its", "start": 1428.72, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "decisions and its capacity to act.", "start": 1432.96, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "Antigga and Babuda welcomes the", "start": 1437.44, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "initiative led by France and Mexico", "start": 1440.64, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "calling on the permanent members to", "start": 1444.32, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "retrain", "start": 1447.44, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "refrain voluntarily from using the veto", "start": 1449.52, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "but use it especially in situations", "start": 1454.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "where of mass atrocities.", "start": 1457.36, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "We will join the growing number of", "start": 1460.08, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "member states, last count 127, in", "start": 1463.2, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "supporting this call.", "start": 1466.72, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "The veto must not paralyze the council's", "start": 1469.6, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "work or prevent it from fulfilling its", "start": 1472.799, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "responsibility to maintaining", "start": 1476.88, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "international peace and security.", "start": 1479.279, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "Reform must also address represent", "start": 1482.799, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "representation.", "start": 1486.32, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "Africa's continued in exclusion from the", "start": 1488.159, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "permanent membership is an injustice", "start": 1491.679, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "that must be corrected.", "start": 1494.799, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Africa must have permanent", "start": 1497.52, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "representation", "start": 1499.919, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "at the security council. Small island", "start": 1501.44, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "developing states must also have an an", "start": 1504.88, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "assured seat at the table and we call", "start": 1508.88, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "for a dedicated SID seat on a reformed", "start": 1512.159, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "council. Madame President, the council's", "start": 1516.24, "duration": 7.919}, {"text": "credibility depends equally on its", "start": 1520.24, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "response to those who urgently needs its", "start": 1524.159, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "support.", "start": 1528.4, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "The crisis in Haiti is a human tragedy", "start": 1530.159, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "and it and challenges Caribbean", "start": 1534.24, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "stability and democracy.", "start": 1536.64, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "We call on the security council", "start": 1539.279, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "to to renew the mandate of the gang", "start": 1542.72, "duration": 8.559}, {"text": "suppression force and and international", "start": 1547.36, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "partners to pro to provide the personnel", "start": 1551.279, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "equipment and sustain finance needed to", "start": 1555.12, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "shape that mandate and make it", "start": 1559.36, "duration": 6.199}, {"text": "effective.", "start": 1562.559, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Excellencies", "start": 1566.559, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Excellencies, the hardship facing faced", "start": 1570.88, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "by the Cuban people demands our", "start": 1574.159, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "attention.", "start": 1576.799, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "Antigga and Babida call on our friends", "start": 1578.32, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the United States of America and Cuba to", "start": 1581.2, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "return to the table of diplomacy and", "start": 1584.0, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "work as good neighbors would towards", "start": 1587.6, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "resolving their longstanding dispute.", "start": 1590.799, "duration": 9.441}, {"text": "The Cuban people must not bear the", "start": 1596.24, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "collective punishment for p political", "start": 1600.24, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "disagreement. Their well-being must", "start": 1603.76, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "remain central to efforts to find a", "start": 1607.44, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "peaceful lasting solution.", "start": 1611.36, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "Across our region, our purpose is clear.", "start": 1615.279, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "to protect human dignity,", "start": 1618.88, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "strengthen stability and ensure that", "start": 1622.0, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "dialogue and cooperation prevail.", "start": 1626.0, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "Excellencies, the world is changing. Its", "start": 1630.32, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "climates, its technology and its balance", "start": 1634.08, "duration": 9.64}, {"text": "of of economic power are all changing.", "start": 1637.679, "duration": 6.041}, {"text": "The United Nations must change with it.", "start": 1646.08, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "Its f it however its funding founding", "start": 1650.64, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "principles must endure.", "start": 1654.48, "duration": 9.36}, {"text": "The equality of nations, the dignity of", "start": 1658.08, "duration": 9.839}, {"text": "people, the sovereignty of states and", "start": 1663.84, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "the respect for international law must", "start": 1667.919, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "hold fast. Madame President,", "start": 1671.44, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "let the United Nations reform strengthen", "start": 1675.36, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "multilateralism.", "start": 1679.44, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Let international law protect every", "start": 1681.52, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "nation. Let finance serve development", "start": 1685.039, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "rather than deepen debts. Let us", "start": 1689.279, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "implement Abbas, protect our oceans, and", "start": 1692.799, "duration": 9.681}, {"text": "invest in our human dignity.", "start": 1698.159, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "And as this organizations prepare for", "start": 1702.48, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "new leadership, let us choose leadership", "start": 1705.679, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "equal to this moment and these tasks. In", "start": 1709.6, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "excellencies, history will not judge us", "start": 1714.559, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "by the number of resolutions we adopt.", "start": 1717.76, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "It will however judge us by whether we", "start": 1720.88, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "acted when the seas rose,", "start": 1724.399, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "when inequality deepened, when", "start": 1727.919, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "international law was violated,", "start": 1730.88, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "and when", "start": 1734.88, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "and when multilateralism", "start": 1736.96, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "faltered. Let us enter this new era with", "start": 1739.12, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "courage in our leadership, fairness in", "start": 1743.279, "duration": 8.321}, {"text": "our decisions, and hope in our in our", "start": 1747.44, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "common future.", "start": 1751.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "It is the hope of Antigga and Babbuda", "start": 1754.159, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "that this United Nation can still", "start": 1757.44, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "fulfill the promise of its charter. I", "start": 1761.039, "duration": 6.601}, {"text": "thank you.", "start": 1764.48, "duration": 3.16}, {"text": "I thank the chair of delegation of", "start": 1771.2, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "Antigga and Barbuda.", "start": 1773.6, "duration": 3.72}]